{"ticker":{"symbol":"109820.KQ","name":"진매트릭스","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":1306.0,"change_pct":-0.021722846441947552,"market_cap":26073198592.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":2795.0,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Diagnostics & Research","country":"South Korea","city":"Seongnam-si","employees":null,"website":"https://www.genematrix.net","business_summary":"GeneMatrix Inc. develops diagnostic products for various diseases in the field of molecular diagnostics. The company offers products for hepatitis B, hepatitis C, cervical cancer, sexually transmitted infections, respiratory infections, and gastrointestinal infections; vaccines for preventing various diseases; and new natural pharmaceutical materials for health enhancement and treatment. It also provides biochemical diagnostics, such as special chemistry and general chemistry, that includes semi and full auto analyer, and calibrators and controls. The company was founded in 2000 and is headquartered in Seongnam-si, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"진매트릭스(주)는 분자진단 분야의 다양한 질병에 대한 진단 제품을 개발하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 B형 간염, C형 간염, 자궁경부암, 성병, 호흡기 감염 및 위장 감염에 대한 제품을 제공합니다. 각종 질병 예방용 백신; 건강증진 및 치료를 위한 천연의약품 신소재를 개발하고 있습니다. 또한 반자동 및 완전 자동 분석기, 교정기 및 제어 장치를 포함하는 특수 화학 및 일반 화학과 같은 생화학적 진단을 제공합니다. 2000년에 설립된 회사로 대한민국 성남시에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"진단·연구","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":11214478720.0,"operating_income":-1522925020.0,"net_income":-8111332370.0,"eps":-406.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":9814502680.0,"operating_income":-2548039070.0,"net_income":-894937560.0,"eps":-45.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":10018845650.0,"operating_income":-1641651370.0,"net_income":-3748057570.0,"eps":-188.0},{"period":"2025","revenue":10643335000.0,"operating_income":-679131130.0,"net